{"term": {"label": "道", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "6A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/gaozi-i", "title": "告子上", "description": "告子曰：「性，猶杞柳也；義，猶桮棬也。以人性為仁義，猶以杞柳為桮棬。」\n孟子曰：「子能順杞柳之性而以為桮棬乎？將戕賊杞柳而後以為桮棬也？如將戕賊杞柳而以為桮棬，則亦將戕賊人以為仁義與？率天下之人而禍仁義者，必子之言夫！」\n告子曰：「性猶湍水也，決諸東方則東流，決諸西方則西流。人性之無分於善不善也，猶水之無分於東西也。」", "occurrences": 3, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "使", "id": "使"}, {"form": "受", "id": "受"}, {"form": "天下", "id": "天下"}, {"form": "天爵", "id": "天爵"}, {"form": "存", "id": "存"}, {"form": "學", "id": "學"}, {"form": "志", "id": "志"}, {"form": "惡", "id": "惡"}, {"form": "指", "id": "指"}, {"form": "放", "id": "放"}, {"form": "敬", "id": "敬"}, {"form": "死", "id": "死"}, {"form": "求", "id": "求"}, {"form": "目", "id": "目"}, {"form": "知", "id": "知"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "見", "id": "見"}, {"form": "身", "id": "身"}, {"form": "道", "variants": [], "id": "道"}, {"form": "鄉", "id": "郷"}, {"form": "類", "id": "類"}, {"form": "飲食", "id": "飲食"}, {"form": "養", "id": "養"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.9633018917671825, "source": "禮", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.605155777939577, "source": "禮", "target": "受"}, {"weight": 1.079099474444528, "source": "指", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2.017369113037458, "source": "指", "target": "養"}, {"weight": 1.4845645825526923, "source": "人", "target": "使"}, {"weight": 1.079099474444528, "source": "人", "target": "郷"}, {"weight": 1.4845645825526923, "source": "人", "target": "見"}, {"weight": 1.4845645825526923, "source": "人", "target": "存"}, {"weight": 0.3859522938845827, "source": "人", "target": "志"}, {"weight": 0.7914174019927469, "source": "人", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 0.3859522938845827, "source": "人", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 1.079099474444528, "source": "人", "target": "飲食"}, {"weight": 1.079099474444528, "source": "人", "target": "天爵"}, {"weight": 2.9618307218783095, "source": "惡", "target": "死"}, {"weight": 1.72